#: tvisnewzonewizard.caption
msgid "New Zone Wizard"
msgstr "新建区域向导"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label1.caption
msgid "Welcome to the New Zone Wizard"
msgstr "欢迎使用新建区域向导"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label10.caption
msgid "Create a copy of a zone containing inly Name Server (NS), Start of Authority (SOA), and possibly glue Host (A) records. A server containing a stub zone is not authoritative for that zone."
msgstr "创建一个仅包含名称服务器 (NS)、起始授权机构 (SOA)，以及可能的粘附主机 (A) 记录的区域副本。包含存根区域的服务器并不是该区域的权威服务器。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label11.caption
msgid "Store the zone in Active Directory (available only if DNS server is a writeable domain controller)"
msgstr "将区域存储在 Active Directory 中（仅当 DNS 服务器是可写域控制器时可用）"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label12.caption
msgid "Active Directory Zone Replication Scope"
msgstr "Active Directory 区域复制范围"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label13.caption
msgid "You can select how you want DNS data replicated throughout your network."
msgstr "你可以选择 DNS 数据在整个网络中的复制方式。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label14.caption
msgid "Select how you want zone data replicated:"
msgstr "选择区域数据的复制方式："

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label15.caption
msgid "To all DNS servers running on domain controllers in this forest:"
msgstr "到此林中域控制器上运行的所有 DNS 服务器："

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label16.caption
msgid "To all DNS servers running on domain controllers in this domain:"
msgstr "到此域中域控制器上运行的所有 DNS 服务器："

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label17.caption
msgid "To all domain controllers in this domain (for Windows 2000 compatibility):"
msgstr "复制到此域中的所有域控制器（用于 Windows 2000 兼容性）："

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label18.caption
msgid "To all domain controllers specified in the scoper of this directory partition:"
msgstr "到此目录分区范围中指定的所有域控制器："

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label19.caption
msgid "Zone Name"
msgstr "区域名称"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label2.caption
msgid "This wizard helps you create a new zone for your DNS server."
msgstr "此向导帮助你为 DNS 服务器创建新区。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label20.caption
msgid "What is the name of the new zone?"
msgstr "新区的名称是什么？"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label21.caption
msgid "The zone name specifies the portion of the DNS namespace for which this server is autoritative. It might be your organization's domain name (for example, example.com) or a portion of the domain name (for example, newzone.example.com). The zone name is not the name of the DNS server."
msgstr "区域名称指定 DNS 命名空间中由该服务器负责的部分。它可以是组织的域名（例如 example.com），也可以是域名的一部分（例如 newzone.example.com）。区域名称不是 DNS 服务器的名称。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label22.caption
msgid "Zone name:"
msgstr "Zone name："

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label23.caption
msgid "Zone File"
msgstr "区域文件"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label24.caption
msgid "You can create a new zone file or use a file copied from another DNS server."
msgstr "你可以创建新的区域文件，或使用从另一台 DNS 服务器复制的文件。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label25.caption
msgid "Do you want to create a new zone file or use an existing file that you have copied from another DNS server?"
msgstr "要创建新的区域文件，还是使用已从另一台 DNS 服务器复制的现有文件？"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label26.caption
msgid "To use this existing file, ensure that it has been copied to the folder %SystemRoot%\\system32\\dns on this server, and then click Next."
msgstr "要使用现有文件，请确保它已复制到此服务器的 %SystemRoot%\\system32\\dns 文件夹，然后单击“下一步”。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label27.caption
msgid "Create a new file with this file name:"
msgstr "使用此文件名创建新文件："

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label28.caption
msgid "Use this existing file:"
msgstr "Use this existing file："

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label29.caption
msgid "You can specify that this DNS zone accepts secure, nonsecure, or no dynamic updates."
msgstr "你可以指定此 DNS 区域接受安全动态更新、非安全动态更新，或不接受动态更新。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label3.caption
msgid "A zone translates DNS names to related data, such as IP addresses or network services."
msgstr "区域将 DNS 名称转换为相关数据，例如 IP 地址或网络服务。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label30.caption
msgid "Dynamic Update"
msgstr "动态更新"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label31.caption
msgid "Dynamic updates enable DNS client computers to register and dynamically update their resource records with a DNS server whenever changes occur."
msgstr "动态更新允许 DNS 客户端计算机在发生更改时向 DNS 服务器注册并动态更新其资源记录。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label32.caption
msgid "Select the type of dynamic updates you want to allow:"
msgstr "选择允许的动态更新类型："

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label33.caption
msgid "Allow only secure dynamic updates (recommanded for Active Directory)"
msgstr "仅允许安全动态更新（推荐用于 Active Directory）"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label34.caption
msgid "This option is available only for Active Directory-integrated zones."
msgstr "此选项仅适用于 Active Directory 集成区域。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label35.caption
msgid "Allow both nonsecure and secure dynamic updates"
msgstr "同时允许非安全和安全的动态更新"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label36.caption
msgid "Dynamic updates of resource records are accepted from any client."
msgstr "接受来自任何客户端的资源记录动态更新。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label37.caption
msgid "This option is a significant security vulnerability because updates can be accepted from untrusted sources."
msgstr "此选项存在重大安全风险，因为它会接受来自不受信任来源的更新。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label38.caption
msgid "Do not allow dynamic updates"
msgstr "不允许动态更新"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label39.caption
msgid "Dynamic updates of resource records are not accepted by this zone. You must update these records manually."
msgstr "此区域不接受资源记录的动态更新。必须手动更新这些记录。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label4.caption
msgctxt "tvisnewzonewizard.label4.caption"
msgid "To continue, click Next."
msgstr "创建一个仅包含名称服务器 (NS)、起始授权机构 (SOA)，以及可能的粘附主机 (A) 记录的区域副本。包含存根区域的服务器并不是该区域的权威服务器。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label40.caption
msgid "Completing the New Zone Wizard"
msgstr "正在完成新建区域向导"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label41.caption
msgid "You have successfully completed the New Zone Wizard. You specified the following settings:"
msgstr "你已成功完成新建区域向导。你指定了以下设置："

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label42.caption
msgid "Note: You should now add records to the zone or ensure that records are updated dynamically. You can then verify name resolution using nslookup."
msgstr "注意：现在应向区域添加记录，或确保记录可动态更新。然后可以使用 nslookup 验证名称解析。"

#: tvisnewzonewizard.label43.caption
